<https://www.metaconceptualart.com/data/linked-art/evidence-press-release-2014> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "A press release written by the studio principal in May 2014, headed 'Metaconceptual Art creates Hedge Fund Art and paints Art Market Reform.' It announces that he 'is creating an entire Art movement in Eugene, Oregon, coined \"Metaconceptual Art\"', names Sun and Rain Works as his art business, and quotes him: 'First I was an Artist, then I was a business Artist, now I am a Metaconceptual Artist.' It states the goal of Metaconceptual Art as 'to examine the interdisciplinary intersections of Art, Art History, Philosophy, Economics, and Art's relationship to the cultural historical narrative of civilization, in our contemporary situation', declares that 'Metaconceptual Art is the Art historical paradigm, which comes after Conceptual Art', sets out its eight defining characteristics, and links the studio's Saatchi Art account for the works Art Market Reform, What Hedge Funds ?! and Art is Capital. On 2014-05-18 the studio sent it by Facebook message to two New York writers, at 13:27:18 UTC and 22:42:00 UTC by Facebook's clock. Neither replied. The studio also holds the release as a Word file dated in its text 20 May 2014." .
<https://www.metaconceptualart.com/data/linked-art/evidence-press-release-2014> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P1_is_identified_by> _:r27b1 .
