_:r17b0 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P75i_is_possessed_by> <https://www.metaconceptualart.com/data/linked-art/sun-and-rain-works> .
_:r17b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E30_Right> .
