_:r5b3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Assembly of the Metaconceptual Art collection" .
_:r5b4 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P82a_begin_of_the_begin> "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
_:r5b4 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P82b_end_of_the_end> "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
